{"Missing nil check for host lookup - update and destroy actions use EmbeddableHost.where(...).first without checking for nil, causing NoMethodError instead of controlled response": 0.8936578631401062, "Unchecked nil access when category_id parameter is missing - save_host method accesses params[:embeddable_host][:category_id] without checking if params[:embeddable_host] exists, causing TypeError on malformed requests": 0.7044497132301331, "No dependent: :nullify on Category model for EmbeddableHost relationship - when Category is deleted, EmbeddableHost records become orphaned with invalid category references, breaking data integrity": 0.7311221361160278, "Migration uses unsafe string interpolation for SQL INSERT vulnerable to SQL injection - host value is directly interpolated without parameterization, breaking on special characters and vulnerable to injection": 0.9110090732574463, "Migration doesn't handle case where embeddable_hosts setting doesn't exist - will silently create zero records": 0.3174031674861908, "Fabricator file missing embeddable_host definition - file only contains category fabricators but should contain Fabricator(:embeddable_host) definition, causing all tests using Fabricate(:embeddable_host) to fail": 0.6855049133300781, "Missing null check when accessing host.category.id in edit action - if host.category is null/undefined, categoryId will be undefined causing unexpected behavior": 0.6193572878837585, "EmbeddableHostSerializer missing category relationship data - serializer only exposes category_id but UI component expects nested category object for displaying category badges": 0.7791843414306641, "Possible undefined values in plural array hydration - _hydrateEmbedded method can include undefined values in hydrated arrays when _lookupSubType returns undefined, should filter them out": 0.8887825608253479, "expandable_first_post? no longer checks if embeddable hosts exist - removed check for embeddable_hosts.present? changes behavior so posts are expandable regardless of whether embedding is configured": 0.672042727470398}